{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26972","headline":"酬光禄田卿六韵见寄 · 姚合","name":"酬光禄田卿六韵见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"以病辞朝谒，迂疎种药翁。\n心弥念鱼鸟，诏遣理兵戎。\n遶户旌旗影，吹人鼓角风。\n雪晴嵩岳顶，树老陕城宫。\n莅职才微薄，归山路未通。\n名卿诗句峭，诮我在关东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}